OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers to
OL,6,Fbegin in the south this evening,
OL,7,Fpushing to central areas later.
OL,8,FFeeling cold, though without the risk
OL,9,Fof frost. It will become breezy
OL,10,Fthroughout, but will feel especially
OL,11,Fchilly along southern coasts where a
OL,12,Fstrong wind persists.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FHeavy and persistent rain
OL,15,Falong far western coasts, paired with
OL,16,Fa blustery, fresh breeze which eases
OL,17,Fduring the afternoon. Further east,
OL,18,Fcold, dull and breezy with spells of
OL,19,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
